From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Freifunk im Neanderland <projekt@neanderfunk.de>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:07:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] batman-adv, batctl: update to 2024.3 with fixes from
 openwrt-24.10
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bring batman-adv and batctl of the OpenWrt 19.07 routing feed (Gluon
v2021.1.x) to version 2024.3 and add the bug and security fixes which the
OpenWrt routing feed carries for 2024.3 in openwrt-24.10.

Base is Gluon PR #3377 by Linus Lüssing ("batman-adv: update to version
2024.3", also used by ffac/site v2021.1.x and, via T-X/gluon-batman-adv-next,
by Freifunk Lübeck): batman-adv 2024.3 with Linux 4.14 compat reverts
(0490, 0491, 0501-0512), noflood mark (2002) and the Gluon multicast router
hack (9001), batctl 2024.3 with noflood_mark.

On top of that:

* batman-adv/patches/0001-0101: unmodified copy of OpenWrt routing
  openwrt-24.10 batman-adv/patches (state "merge bugfixes from 2026.3",
  78bcc66). This covers all batman-adv CVEs published until 2026-10-03,
  among them CVE-2026-52916, CVE-2026-31659 and CVE-2026-72226.
* 0102-0105: upstream fixes from batman-adv.git which are not yet in
  openwrt-24.10 (742a0e35, d0ded7c5, 9c7a6f34, 745e4677).
* The 4.14 compat patches from #3377 were moved behind the fixes and
  refreshed (0001 -> 0490, 0003 -> 0491); 0002 and 0004 of #3377 are
  identical to openwrt-24.10 0001 and 0002.
* src/compat-hacks.h: skb_set_transport_header_careful() from
  openwrt-24.10, rcu_replace_pointer() for < 5.5 and timer_shutdown_sync()
  fallback for < 6.2 (del_timer_sync() + del_timer(), as batman-adv did
  before "tp_meter: directly shut down timer on cleanup").
* batman-adv: PKG_RELEASE 2, drop the brmldproxy dependencies (only for
  Linux 5.15/6.6, package not available here).
* batctl: pass -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections -flto and
  -Wl,--gc-sections explicitly, OpenWrt 19.07 ignores PKG_BUILD_FLAGS.

Compile tested as out-of-tree module against the Gluon v2021.1.x
ar71xx-tiny kernel (4.14.275, mips_24kc, backports 4.19.237); not yet run
tested.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
